  "title": "Cintas Corporation Announces Fiscal 2026 Fourth Quarter and Full Year Results",
  "summary": "Cintas Corporation (Nasdaq: CTAS) today reported results for its fiscal 2026 fourth quarter ended May 31, 2026. Revenue for the fourth quarter of fiscal 2026 was $2.91 billion compared to $2.67 billion in last year’s fourth quarter, an increase of 8.9%.",
